  {"date": "2016-07-02", "venue": "Saratoga Performing Arts Center", "city": "Saratoga Springs", "state": "NY", "gap": 6, "set": "1", "note": "Trey on Marimba Lumina.", "out": ">", "prev": "Divided Sky", "next": "Rift", "nb": 1},
  {"date": "2016-07-10", "venue": "Lakeview Amphitheater", "city": "Syracuse", "state": "NY", "gap": 5, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "> from \"Rocky Top\". It's another \"Martian Monster\" rotation jam! One of the longest versions since the debut sees Trey hop on the Marimba Lumina, Mike on guitar and Page on bass. Straddling both playful and serious, this jam culminates with all four band members singing/hissing/shouting \"Your trip is short!\" as Page's sample echoes the same thing. > into \"Golgi\".", "note": "Trey on Marimba Lumina; Mike on guitar; Page on bass.", "out": ">", "prev": "Rocky Top", "in": ">", "next": "Golgi Apparatus", "nb": 1},
